h more context and partial GPU offload:",[284,1037,1039],{"className":286,"code":1038,"language":289,"meta":290,"style":290},"llama-crab-server \\\n  --model \u002Fmodels\u002Fchat.gguf \\\n  --model-name local-chat \\\n  --n-ctx 4096 \\\n  --n-gpu-layers 32\n",[226,1040,1041,1047,1056,1066,1076],{"__ignoreMap":290},[294,1042,1043,1045],{"class":296,"line":297},[294,1044,228],{"class":300},[294,1046,413],{"class":412},[294,1048,1049,1051,1054],{"class":296,"line":416},[294,1050,419],{"class":304},[294,1052,1053],{"class":304}," \u002Fmodels\u002Fchat.gguf",[294,1055,413],{"class":412},[294,1057,1058,1061,1064],{"class":296,"line":427},[294,1059,1060],{"class":304},"  --model-name",[294,1062,1063],{"class":304}," local-chat",[294,1065,413],{"class":412},[294,1067,1068,1071,1074],{"class":296,"line":439},[294,1069,1070],{"class":304},"  --n-ctx",[294,1072,1073],{"class":433}," 4096",[294,1075,413],{"class":412},[294,1077,1078,1081],{"class":296,"line":530},[294,1079,1080],{"class":304},"  --n-gpu-layers",[294,1082,1083],{"class":433}," 32\n",[223,1085,1086],{},"Embedding model with mean pooling:",[284,1088,1090],{"className":286,"code":1089,"language":289,"meta":290,"style":290},"llama-crab-server \\\n  --model \u002Fmodels\u002Fembed.gguf \\\n  --model-name local-embed \\\n  --embeddings \\\n  --pooling mean\n",[226,1091,1092,1098,1107,1116,1123],{"__ignoreMap":290},[294,1093,1094,1096],{"class":296,"line":297},[294,1095,228],{"class":300},[294,1097,413],{"class":412},[294,1099,1100,1102,1105],{"class":296,"line":416},[294,1101,419],{"class":304},[294,1103,1104],{"class":304}," \u002Fmodels\u002Fembed.gguf",[294,1106,413],{"class":412},[294,1108,1109,1111,1114],{"class":296,"line":427},[294,1110,1060],{"class":304},[294,1112,1113],{"class":304}," local-embed",[294,1115,413],{"class":412},[294,1117,1118,1121],{"class":296,"line":439},[294,1119,1120],{"class":304},"  --embeddings",[294,1122,413],{"class":412},[294,1124,1125,1128],{"class":296,"line":530},[294,1126,1127],{"class":304},"  --pooling",[294,1129,1130],{"class":304}," mean\n",[223,1132,1133],{},"Cross-encoder reranker:",[284,1135,1137],{"className":286,"code":1136,"language":289,"meta":290,"style":290},"llama-crab-server \\\n  --model \u002Fmodels\u002Freranker.gguf \\\n  --model-name local-reranker \\\n  --reranking \\\n  --pooling rank\n",[226,1138,1139,1145,1154,1163,1170],{"__ignoreMap":290},[294,1140,1141,1143],{"class":296,"line":297},[294,1142,228],{"class":300},[294,1144,413],{"class":412},[294,1146,1147,1149,1152],{"class":296,"line":416},[294,1148,419],{"class":304},[294,1150,1151],{"class":304}," \u002Fmodels\u002Freranker.gguf",[294,1153,413],{"class":412},[294,1155,1156,1158,1161],{"class":296,"line":427},[294,1157,1060],{"class":304},[294,1159,1160],{"class":304}," local-reranker",[294,1162,413],{"class":412},[294,1164,1165,1168],{"class":296,"line":439},[294,1166,1167],{"class":304},"  --reranking",[294,1169,413],{"class":412},[294,1171,1172,1174],{"class":296,"line":530},[294,1173,1127],{"class":304},[294,1175,1176],{"class":304}," rank\n",[223,1178,1179],{},"Multimodal chat (vision):",[284,1181,1183],{"className":286,"code":1182,"language":289,"meta":290,"style":290},"llama-crab-server \\\n  --model \u002Fmodels\u002Fvision.gguf \\\n  --mmproj \u002Fmodels\u002Fmmproj.gguf\n",[226,1184,1185,1191,1200],{"__ignoreMap":290},[294,1186,1187,1189],{"class":296,"line":297},[294,1188,228],{"class":300},[294,1190,413],{"class":412},[294,1192,1193,1195,1198],{"class":296,"line":416},[294,1194,419],{"class":304},[294,1196,1197],{"class":304}," \u002Fmodels\u002Fvision.gguf",[294,1199,413],{"class":412},[294,1201,1202,1205],{"class":296,"line":427},[294,1203,1204],{"class":304},"  --mmproj",[294,1206,1207],{"class":304}," \u002Fmodels\u002Fmmproj.gguf\n",[223,1209,1210,1211,1214,1215,1218],{},"The multimodal path requires the binary to be built with ",[226,1212,1213],{},"--features mtmd",". Image parts in chat messages are accepted as ",[226,1216,1217],{},"data:image\u002F...;base64,..."," URLs or as local file paths.",[223,1220,1221,1222,1224],{},"Hugging Face model (with ",[226,1223,356],{}," feature enabled):",[284,1226,1228],{"className":286,"code":1227,"language":289,"meta":290,"style":290},"llama-crab-server \\\n  --model TheBloke\u002FLlama-2-7B-Chat-GGUF \\\n  --hf-filename llama-2-7b-chat.Q4_K_M.gguf\n",[226,1229,1230,1236,1245],{"__ignoreMap":290},[294,1231,1232,1234],{"class":296,"line":297},[294,1233,228],{"class":300},[294,1235,413],{"class":412},[294,1237,1238,1240,1243],{"class":296,"line":416},[294,1239,419],{"class":304},[294,1241,1242],{"class":304}," TheBloke\u002FLlama-2-7B-Chat-GGUF",[294,1244,413],{"class":412},[294,1246,1247,1250],{"class":296,"line":427},[294,1248,1249],{"class":304},"  --hf-filename",[294,1251,1252],{"class":304}," llama-2-7b-chat.Q4_K_M.gguf\n",[223,1254,1255,1256,1258],{},"Mobile preset example (overrides the legacy ",[226,1257,878],{}," defaults):",[284,1260,1262],{"className":286,"code":1261,"language":289,"meta":290,"style":290},"llama-crab-server \\\n  --model \u002Fmodels\u002Fchat.gguf \\\n  --mobile-preset low-ram\n",[226,1263,1264,1270,1278],{"__ignoreMap":290},[294,1265,1266,1268],{"class":296,"line":297},[294,1267,228],{"class":300},[294,1269,413],{"class":412},[294,1271,1272,1274,1276],{"class":296,"line":416},[294,1273,419],{"class":304},[294,1275,1053],{"class":304},[294,1277,413],{"class":412},[294,1279,1280,1283],{"class":296,"line":427},[294,1281,1282],{"class":304},"  --mobile-preset",[294,1284,1285],{"class":304}," low-ram\n",[277,1287,1289],{"id":1288},"process-and-worker-model","Process and worker model",[1291,1292,1293,1309,1320,1333],"ul",{},[1294,1295,1296,1297,1300,1301,1304,1305,1308],"li",{},"Model loading (",[226,1298,1299],{},"Llama::load",") happens inside the dedicated ",[226,1302,1303],{},"llama-crab-worker"," thread (",[226,1306,1307],{},"main.rs:881","). If the load fails the worker exits and the binary returns an error before binding the port — there is no degraded mode.",[1294,1310,1311,1312,1315,1316,1319],{},"HTTP request handlers run on tokio's async runtime and forward work to the worker through a ",[226,1313,1314],{},"std::sync::mpsc::channel\u003CJob>",". The worker processes one ",[226,1317,1318],{},"Job"," at a time; HTTP requests queue in the channel while a generation is in flight.",[1294,1321,1322,1323,1326,1327,241,1330,559],{},"CORS is ",[226,1324,1325],{},"CorsLayer::permissive()"," and request tracing is ",[226,1328,1329],{},"TraceLayer::new_for_http()",[226,1331,1332],{},"main.rs:672-673",[1294,1334,1335,1336,1339],{},"The server installs no graceful-shutdown handler; ",[226,1337,1338],{},"Ctrl+C"," aborts the process via tokio's default behaviour.",[223,1341,1342,1343,1345],{},"See ",[243,1344,97],{"href":98}," for health checks, logging tuning and capacity planning.",[277,1347,1349],{"id":1348},"versioning-and-changes","Versioning and changes",[223,1351,1352,1353,1356,1357,1360,1361,1363,1364,1366,1367,1369,1370,1373,1374,1377],{},"The server first shipped in ",[238,1354,1355],{},"0.1.4 (2026-06-14)",", the documentation site moved in ",[238,1358,1359],{},"0.1.5 (2026-06-15)",", and opt-in Hugging Face support — the ",[226,1362,356],{}," Cargo feature and the ",[226,1365,631],{}," \u002F ",[226,1368,636],{}," flag — was added in ",[238,1371,1372],{},"0.1.6 (2026-06-15)",". Refer to the ",[243,1375,248],{"href":245,"rel":1376},[247]," for the full list of changes that affect every crate in the workspace.",[1379,1380,1381],"style",{},"html pre.shiki code .sBMFI, html code.shiki .sBMFI{--shiki-light:#E2931D;--shiki-default:#FFCB6B;--shiki-dark:#FFCB6B}html pre.shiki code .sfazB, html code.shiki .sfazB{--shiki-light:#91B859;--shiki-default:#C3E88D;--shiki-dark:#C3E88D}html .light .shiki span {color: var(--shiki-light);background: var(--shiki-light-bg);font-style: var(--shiki-light-font-style);font-weight: var(--shiki-light-font-weight);text-decoration: var(--shiki-light-text-decoration);}html.l